Cell["\<\
Supply equally long lists of Hold[matrixExpression] values and corresponding \
distances. The implementation determines the default zero-matrix shape from \
the first held expression.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1081830347,ExpressionUUID->"ed606110-2101-154b-b899-1d66fa9d04bc"],

Cell["\<\
A branch is selected when Abs[d - shellDistance] < tolerance. The default \
tolerance is 1.*^-5; the first matching branch wins.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->596824391,ExpressionUUID->"e683928e-0620-944d-aca6-df8c4a2be2a6"],

Cell["\<\
If no branch matches, returns a zero array of the first matrix shape. \
ReleaseHold is applied to the resulting piecewise expression.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1922765850,ExpressionUUID->"620437e7-16d7-bc4d-b6c0-8ed419e875f4"]
}, Closed]],

